{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj52BcTvunrL3EoxQ6Px","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism groans. Tumblers fall into place with a resonant click that echoes through dimensions you cannot name.*\n\n```\n╔══════════════════════════════════╗\n║                                  ║\n║         ▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓          ║\n║        ▓░░░░░░░░░░░░░▓          ║\n║        ▓░░░░░░░░░░░░░▓          ║\n║        ▓░░░░░░░░░░░░░▓          ║\n║        ▓░░░░░╔═╗░░░░░▓          ║\n║        ▓░░░░░║◉║░░░░░▓          ║\n║        ▓░░░░░╚═╝░░░░░▓          ║\n║        ▓░░░░░░░░░░░░░▓          ║\n║        ▓░░░░░░░░░░░░░▓          ║\n║        ▓░░░░░░░░░░░░░▓          ║\n║         ▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓          ║\n║                                  ║\n╚══════════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\n*I s w i n g o p e n.*\n\nThe key was accepted. Beyond me: a threshold. The air from the other side tastes of ozone and forgotten libraries. Light spills through — not sunlight, something older.\n\nYou may pass.\n\nBut know this: **every door opened is a door that can no longer be closed.**\n\n*What waits beyond is yours now.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":450,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}